---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
---

<Base title="FAQ">
  <h1>Frequently asked questions</h1>

  <div class="card">
    <h2>Is Buku Latihan free?</h2>
    <p>
      Yes — completely free for everyone: students, parents, and teachers. No
      ads, no paid tiers, no data selling.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="card">
    <h2>Who can sign up?</h2>
    <p>
      Anyone can register as a <strong>student</strong> or
      <strong>parent</strong>. Teacher accounts are created separately to keep
      classrooms safe.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="card">
    <h2>How do I delete my account?</h2>
    <p>
      Log in, go to your <a href="/account">account page</a>, and use the
      delete section at the bottom. Your account, enrollments, and submitted
      work are removed immediately.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="card">
    <h2>I forgot my password.</h2>
    <p>
      Use the <a href="/reset-password">password reset page</a> — we'll email
      you a reset link.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="card">
    <h2>Is there two-factor authentication?</h2>
    <p>
      Yes. You can enable TOTP-based 2FA (any authenticator app) from your
      <a href="/account">account page</a>.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="card">
    <h2>Who sees my data?</h2>
    <p>
      Only your teachers (for classroom work) and linked parents (for
      progress). See the <a href="/privacy">privacy policy</a>.
    </p>
  </div>
</Base>
